<title>UK: TABLE-ECC has yr loss, cuts div by quarter.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ECC has yr loss, cuts div by quarter.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr, pre-exceps(pence) 11.43		  vs 22.15</p>
<p> Shr (pence)	 loss 18.83		  vs 21.04 earning</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 7.0		    vs 11.2</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 12.5		   vs 16.7</p>
<p> Pretax loss		42.9		   vs 95.1 profit</p>
<p> Turnover		   846.3		  vs 885.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Specialty chemicals and building materials supplier English Chinal Clays Plc said the new annual dividend rate was a base from which future dividend growth could be generated.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44-171 542 7717</p>
